# Filenames listed here (basename only, one per line) are never overwritten
# by scripts/sync-from-template.sh. The project's own copy is kept.
#
# ci.yml, codeql.yml, lint.yml, security.yml, accessibility.yml,
# release.yml: on 2026-07-19 these carried newer pinned GitHub Actions SHAs
# than the team master template (from Dependabot pull requests #24 and
# #25), so a sync would have silently reverted that work every time it
# ran. Protecting them until the master template catches up. Remove this
# protection once the master's action pins are current again.
#
# deploy.yml: carries this project's own custom includes -- /CNAME (serves
# the custom domain projects.timdixon.net; see
# docs/decisions/003-hosting-domain-headers.md) and /soa/*** (publishes
# privacy.html and tos.html). The generic template variant does not know
# about either path. A sync on 2026-07-19 would have dropped both and
# broken the live deploy.
accessibility.yml
ci.yml
codeql.yml
deploy.yml
lint.yml
release.yml
security.yml
